Z||000000||frontal lobe||12-12-2000||11:09 PM||||Hey, how many are giving out chia pets for Christmas this year?????  Due to travel, etc., my brother and 3 sisters had to get together for Christmas last Saturday.  We draw names and give gifts.  My lame brother-in-law never gave me a list of what he wanted until it was too late to order for him.  I didn't want to show up empty handed so I went to Walgreen's and got him a "Chia-taz".  Oh yeah, it was a big hit.  You should have seen his face when he opened it.<P>My apologies to anyone if I got that jingle stuck in your head now.||||reg||1
